{"type":"standard","title":"Russell Fry","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Russell Fry</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q96015883","titles":{"canonical":"Russell_Fry","normalized":"Russell Fry","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Russell Fry</span></span>"},"pageid":64158925,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8c/Russell_Fry_119th_Congress.jpg/330px-Russell_Fry_119th_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":412},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8c/Russell_Fry_119th_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":1122,"height":1402},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1374360695","tid":"ede38f88-adf2-11f1-baa5-5b257cf65988","timestamp":"2026-09-11T15:10:31Z","description":"American politician (born 1985)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Russell_Fry","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Russell_Fry?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Russell_Fry?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Russell_Fry"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Russell_Fry","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Russell_Fry","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Russell_Fry?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Russell_Fry"}},"extract":"Russell William Fry is an American politician and lawyer serving as the U.S. representative for South Carolina's 7th congressional district since 2023. Previously, he represented the 106th District in the South Carolina House of Representatives from 2015 to 2023. He is a member of the Republican Party.","extract_html":"<p><b>Russell William Fry</b> is an American politician and lawyer serving as the U.S. representative for South Carolina's 7th congressional district since 2023. Previously, he represented the 106th District in the South Carolina House of Representatives from 2015 to 2023. He is a member of the Republican Party.</p>"}